         d_{\mathrm{wc}}\p{\calR_{\calE,Q}^{\s{\s{Petz}}}\circ \calN|_{L(Q)},I_{L(Q)}}\leq \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}\norm{\sqrt{A_{\s{QEC}}}-I_{K}\otimes \frac{1}{\sqrt{K}}\sqrt{\tr_K(A_{\s{QEC}})}}_{\infty}.\label{eq:PetzWCcond}
